   "body": "### Capture result (partial)\nCorpus: `R73a` (user2, 2 categories, a closed topic, a poll), `R73b` (user1, 13 categories, 88 rows, 27 polls, `defaut` theme); PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\nSeveral categories are confirmed, one `fondForum1fCat` header per category. On `owntopic=1`, a followed topic that is also a favourite shows `favoris.gif` (84 rows) instead of `flag1.gif` (4). Legacy misses the `defaut`-theme poll icons (#384).\nStill open: `owntopic=1` with nothing flagged, a row without flag link, a single-page topic, a sticky row. Both accounts follow topics, and emptying a list is a flag write, which this session's mandate (private-only writes) excludes.",
